WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:11.640
This sky is too brilliant, a new dawn has arrived.

00:17.980 --> 00:24.460
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

00:24.560 --> 00:31.560
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

00:32.390 --> 00:39.760
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

00:39.930 --> 00:43.070
If my wish comes true...

00:43.070 --> 00:49.820
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

00:49.820 --> 00:56.540
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

00:56.540 --> 01:06.050
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

01:06.360 --> 01:13.080
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

01:13.370 --> 01:23.760
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

01:31.640 --> 01:33.470
Sixteen years ago,

01:33.470 --> 01:36.070
King Meister, Princea,

01:36.070 --> 01:39.480
and the first princess who was still a baby...

01:39.480 --> 01:43.810
This is the story of their journey to Viella.

01:45.570 --> 01:48.910
The king and his family, who rode in the carriage,

01:48.910 --> 01:54.450
were attacked by mysterious warriors and an Angel.

01:56.560 --> 01:59.630
The king and his family have been missing ever since.

01:59.630 --> 02:04.770
Even now, the crown of Windland remains unclaimed.

02:05.270 --> 02:09.410
This incident has come to be known
as the Tragedy of the Blue Moon.

02:10.130 --> 02:11.990
Using this incident as a start...

02:12.970 --> 02:14.190
Hyaweh!

02:14.530 --> 02:16.190
Y-Yes?

02:16.700 --> 02:19.060
Please pay attention!

02:19.060 --> 02:23.700
This is a very important incident in the history of Windland.

02:23.920 --> 02:27.710
If you keep this up you'll be in trouble for the Pri-test.

02:28.830 --> 02:29.710
Okay.

02:30.370 --> 02:31.210
I'll do my best.

02:41.840 --> 02:45.140
The Knights' Ordeal

02:46.690 --> 02:48.510
In the midst of the blowing wind,

02:48.510 --> 02:51.900
youths have gathered to study here, striving to become knights.

02:52.410 --> 02:57.940
Finally, the Prism Certification Test, to shorten it, the Pri-test, will be held next week.

02:58.440 --> 03:03.450
Using the Prism, we'll test you to see how much power you can give to your sword and your magic.

03:03.450 --> 03:04.960
That's the Pri-Test!

03:04.960 --> 03:07.730
Show us the results of your training.

03:07.730 --> 03:10.160
When you've succeeded in passing the exam,

03:10.410 --> 03:14.790
I will give you this very pretty Prism Authorized License myself!

03:14.850 --> 03:18.460
To shorten it, the new and revised Pri-Pri License!

03:19.050 --> 03:21.970
You don't really need to shorten it like that.

03:22.260 --> 03:24.970
Ladies and gentlemen, I will be looking forward to it.

03:25.300 --> 03:29.480
Everyone's Prism will shake my spirit!

03:38.940 --> 03:42.820
Do you think that you can pass the test like this?

03:49.160 --> 03:52.870
Your gaze, breathing, arms, waist, and legs...

03:53.480 --> 03:54.880
They're all bad.

03:56.580 --> 03:58.500
You are the top student in the school.

03:58.930 --> 04:02.510
This attitude of yours will affect the morale of the whole school.

04:02.880 --> 04:03.670
Stand!

04:06.330 --> 04:09.770
Everyone is overestimating me.

04:10.070 --> 04:12.770
Right, only your mouth is skilled, huh?

04:13.090 --> 04:17.320
Currently you're the worst possible apprentice knight.

04:17.680 --> 04:18.630
I won't lose!

04:29.870 --> 04:31.580
Lady Priecia...

04:33.830 --> 04:35.630
What are you so hesitant about?

04:40.410 --> 04:42.420
<i>Ever since the fire,</i>

04:42.420 --> 04:45.430
<i>it seems that all the girls have started to take notice of Hyaweh.</i>

04:45.740 --> 04:51.690
<i>He disregarded his own safety and went into the fire to save Lady Priecia and Kagura.</i>

04:52.050 --> 04:55.850
<i>Even my heart started to race at that moment.</i>

04:56.520 --> 04:59.750
<i>I thought that he was quite good from the beginning.</i>

04:59.750 --> 05:01.690
<i>I think he's cool.</i>

05:01.970 --> 05:04.100
<i>Right, right. He's really cool.</i>

05:04.100 --> 05:06.690
<i>Eh?! The two of you feel the same way?</i>

05:06.690 --> 05:08.320
<i>Don't you feel that way, too, Aira?</i>

05:08.320 --> 05:13.150
<i>Well, to tell the truth, I felt a burning heat too.</i>

05:22.980 --> 05:26.510
When you're filled with hesitation, victory is impossible.

05:34.060 --> 05:36.810
The name of the talented Priecia has fallen, huh?

05:43.710 --> 05:45.070
This hesitation...

05:45.210 --> 05:48.410
There's no way I will lose to this hesitation!

05:51.660 --> 05:55.450
Saying that you won't lose... It sounds to me like you're admitting defeat.

05:55.450 --> 05:59.860
With you like this, you'll be the first to die on the battlefield.

06:02.250 --> 06:04.240
Glow Lash!

06:17.400 --> 06:19.160
Even though it's just one attack, it hits three areas.

06:19.160 --> 06:21.380
Amazing! How did she do that?

06:21.380 --> 06:23.900
She's able to do it because she's the instructor.

06:24.290 --> 06:25.550
Is it mortifying?

06:27.220 --> 06:28.740
I'm going to ask you now,

06:28.740 --> 06:31.660
why do you want to be a knight?

06:31.810 --> 06:37.160
In order to protect Windland from
the threats of the Sablum Empire.

06:37.280 --> 06:40.170
Protect? What do you want to protect?

06:40.470 --> 06:42.990
The land? The people? The families?

06:42.990 --> 06:44.620
It's not those, right?

06:44.620 --> 06:48.800
What you're trying to protect is that meager pride of yours.

06:50.610 --> 06:53.590
Pride is just a self-satisfaction.

06:53.590 --> 06:58.600
To someone who wields a sword, the only way to become stronger is to let go of yourself.

06:58.600 --> 07:03.730
Only then will you be able to live on for those important to you.

07:04.090 --> 07:09.090
Those who are unable to let go of themselves have no right to wield a sword.

07:12.380 --> 07:14.890
Oh, Aruke...

07:14.890 --> 07:20.000
Just what kind of hesitations does the genius and admired Lady Priecia have?

07:27.450 --> 07:30.110
Huh? The fire won't start.

07:30.110 --> 07:31.630
Leave it to me.

07:34.410 --> 07:35.670
Here, the matches.

07:35.670 --> 07:37.140
No, I won't be needing those.

07:38.260 --> 07:41.140
Obey my words and gather in my hand.

07:41.650 --> 07:46.010
The great power of desire,
the flame of the sleeping salamander.

07:53.260 --> 07:54.600
Everything turned black.

07:54.600 --> 07:56.200
What should we do now?

07:56.420 --> 07:58.450
It's not "what should we do"!

07:59.430 --> 08:00.160
I'm sorry.

08:00.160 --> 08:02.630
How are we going to have dinner now?

08:02.630 --> 08:04.500
The potatoes are safe.

08:04.770 --> 08:07.220
Then, everyone shall eat C-set meals, all right?

08:07.920 --> 08:09.370
Isn't there anything other than potatoes?!

08:12.210 --> 08:15.950
I've never seen such a miserable,
defeated face from Lady Priecia.

08:16.440 --> 08:18.850
I wonder what's really going on.

08:19.340 --> 08:20.960
It must be Hyaweh.

08:21.940 --> 08:23.600
Tell me! Tell me!

08:23.600 --> 08:25.650
What's going on with Hyaweh and Priecia?

08:26.080 --> 08:31.850
In short, Lady Priecia can't be herself because of Hyaweh.

08:31.850 --> 08:33.520
Eh, that means...

08:33.520 --> 08:34.280
Could it be...

08:37.120 --> 08:38.790
Impossible, impossible. It's definitely impossible.

08:41.350 --> 08:45.200
Geez... I feel that this mystery is getting deeper.

08:45.200 --> 08:49.660
Who is that guy that is able to influence Lady Priecia so much?

08:49.660 --> 08:52.310
Don't tell me Hyaweh is the princess?!

08:52.310 --> 08:54.300
That would be impossible. Impossible.

08:58.960 --> 09:02.580
If I can get rid of this hesitation, I'll be able to...

09:11.820 --> 09:13.360
I can't do it?

09:13.360 --> 09:16.110
Why can't I get rid of this hesitation?

09:25.600 --> 09:27.670
What's this?!

09:32.250 --> 09:33.670
Um...

09:34.400 --> 09:36.510
I'm sorry I surprised you.

09:36.510 --> 09:38.610
Did you make that thing just now, Fel?

09:38.610 --> 09:41.180
Yeah. What happened to you, Hyaweh?

09:41.970 --> 09:42.930
I...

09:42.930 --> 09:46.460
Well, I was practicing magic using a Prism,

09:46.460 --> 09:47.990
but I kind of failed.

09:48.300 --> 09:49.290
How about you?

09:49.290 --> 09:52.420
I'm in the middle of practicing ice magic.

09:52.420 --> 09:53.880
That's amazing.

09:53.880 --> 09:56.030
This is still far from complete.

09:56.170 --> 09:58.850
Eh?! Even though it's so pretty?

09:58.850 --> 10:00.650
Hey, how did you do that?

10:00.650 --> 10:02.520
Which part of the manual is it from?

10:03.750 --> 10:06.740
You have to use your heart to use the Prism.

10:06.740 --> 10:09.210
I don't rely on the instruction manual.

10:09.210 --> 10:10.670
It's just theory.

10:11.190 --> 10:13.170
Then, what should I do?

10:13.630 --> 10:15.110
Feel the Prism.

10:19.260 --> 10:26.850
I always think of what kind of wish to put into the Prism to raise my skill.

10:27.000 --> 10:30.460
When I have a spell that I want to use,

10:30.460 --> 10:36.860
I always wish for the magic to be successful no matter what.

10:37.200 --> 10:39.400
What kind of wish?

10:39.400 --> 10:41.620
I want to see the snow.

10:41.620 --> 10:42.370
Snow?

10:42.750 --> 10:46.080
I've never seen snow before.

10:46.080 --> 10:48.620
I have a really close friend,

10:48.620 --> 10:52.020
and I heard that in her home town it's always snowing.

10:52.020 --> 10:54.460
It's pure white and beautiful.

10:54.460 --> 10:58.380
Everytime I listen to her story I wish to see the snow.

10:59.330 --> 11:04.570
That's why we promised each other we'd go there some day to see the snow.

11:05.400 --> 11:06.720
What happened to that friend?

11:10.110 --> 11:13.650
As long as I master ice magic, I'll be able to create snow.

11:14.170 --> 11:18.650
As long as I fulfill this dream, I'll definitely be able to see her.

11:19.090 --> 11:20.830
That's what I've always believed.

11:21.500 --> 11:25.910
Because we promised to see the snow together.

11:52.060 --> 11:54.600
Don't hesitate! I won't lose!

11:54.600 --> 11:55.820
I can't lose!

11:57.030 --> 11:57.820
A promise, huh?

11:58.840 --> 11:59.760
That's right.

12:01.990 --> 12:03.360
What's wrong?

12:04.470 --> 12:05.990
I just remembered.

12:10.850 --> 12:11.740
Hyaweh?

12:14.050 --> 12:15.400
It's a promise.

12:15.400 --> 12:16.210
Huh?

12:17.050 --> 12:18.350
It's about this.

12:30.900 --> 12:32.020
Recall it.

12:32.570 --> 12:33.960
My promise.

12:35.060 --> 12:37.910
And then, feel the Prism.

12:44.820 --> 12:46.480
Glow Lash!

12:49.600 --> 12:52.350
That's not right. I can't rely on this kind of strength.

12:53.370 --> 12:56.210
My instructor's thrust is more precise.

12:57.900 --> 12:59.210
Who's there?

13:06.130 --> 13:07.620
That surprised me.

13:07.620 --> 13:08.810
Thank you, Kagura.

13:10.610 --> 13:11.930
What are you doing here?

13:12.230 --> 13:16.690
Well... Um, you're training for the Pri-test too?

13:17.440 --> 13:19.440
This doesn't concern you.

13:19.930 --> 13:21.440
Lady Priecia.

13:23.250 --> 13:24.950
Food.

13:25.830 --> 13:27.140
A salmon.

13:27.140 --> 13:28.740
Eh? Is that my share?

13:36.290 --> 13:37.060
Drink.

13:37.060 --> 13:38.790
Ah, thank you.

13:39.020 --> 13:40.060
Drink.

13:40.060 --> 13:41.200
O-Okay.

13:46.040 --> 13:48.300
*Chew* *Chew* *Chew*

13:49.420 --> 13:53.380
You know, Fel just said something interesting to me.

13:55.050 --> 13:57.600
Prism is not just a theory.

13:58.300 --> 14:00.380
You need to use it with your heart.

14:00.950 --> 14:05.180
Fel's wish is to fulfill a promise she made with her friend.

14:05.180 --> 14:08.270
That's why she wants to master the utilization of the Prism.

14:08.270 --> 14:11.370
So, she puts her wish into the Prism.

14:11.370 --> 14:14.370
And then, I remembered something.

14:15.740 --> 14:18.400
I also have a promise.

14:18.400 --> 14:21.580
Your promise must not be very important.

14:22.340 --> 14:24.050
That may be true.

14:24.050 --> 14:28.010
A long time ago, I was attacked by an Angel.

14:28.480 --> 14:29.300
An Angel?

14:29.670 --> 14:31.800
You survived well.

14:48.950 --> 14:49.860
<i>Don't worry.</i>

14:50.330 --> 14:52.370
<i>Onii-chan will definitely protect you.</i>

14:52.690 --> 14:54.620
"Definitely protect."

14:54.620 --> 14:57.730
That's what I always said to Filia when we were young.

15:04.670 --> 15:05.420
<i>Onii-chan!</i>

15:05.650 --> 15:08.080
But, I couldn't do anything.

15:27.840 --> 15:31.300
Even now, the voice of that knight resounds in my ears.

15:33.260 --> 15:36.730
<i>Your "definitely" is extremely weak.</i>

15:36.730 --> 15:40.910
<i>Your words are just like those of other weaklings.</i>

15:40.910 --> 15:45.370
<i>In that situation, you and the ones you love will simply die.</i>

15:53.660 --> 15:55.180
"Definitely protect."

15:56.220 --> 15:58.740
Those words came out of my mouth almost instinctively, but...

15:58.740 --> 16:03.490
I didn't know the importance or the responsibility attached to those words.

16:03.490 --> 16:09.190
But to a knight, words such as "protect"
are worth risking their life for.

16:10.120 --> 16:11.190
Protect...

16:12.500 --> 16:16.450
You're also protecting me, acting like my shadow.

16:18.530 --> 16:21.900
Even though it's simple, it's sound reasoning.

16:21.900 --> 16:23.960
Become stronger in order to protect.

16:24.450 --> 16:27.590
Yeah, besides, I'm a knight.

16:27.590 --> 16:32.520
If I can become even stronger,
I might be able to protect more people.

16:33.680 --> 16:36.640
That's what a knight should be, right?

16:37.310 --> 16:37.870
Yeah.

16:39.590 --> 16:42.440
I also want to become stronger.

16:42.440 --> 16:45.230
This means that we share the same goal.

16:45.230 --> 16:46.150
That's right.

16:46.830 --> 16:50.150
Then, you'll be like a rival to me.

16:50.970 --> 16:51.950
Rival?

16:52.130 --> 16:54.740
Place that wish into the Prism.

16:55.540 --> 16:57.100
Break time is over.

17:02.430 --> 17:04.780
Let's work hard together for the Pri-test, okay?

17:08.810 --> 17:09.620
Kagura.

17:10.580 --> 17:13.840
Don't you think my mission is like a promise, too?

17:14.370 --> 17:15.040
Yes.

17:25.120 --> 17:26.230
This reaction...

17:28.800 --> 17:32.400
Geez, if he's the one that has been disturbing my heart...

17:32.400 --> 17:35.310
He's also the person who made me
realize the most important thing.

17:35.950 --> 17:38.110
I will not give out any more meaningless resistance.

17:39.440 --> 17:42.150
I think I will accept that person...

17:42.150 --> 17:44.520
as a good rival so that we can compete with each other.

17:45.760 --> 17:49.130
When I think of it like that, the burden on my shoulders seems to lighten.

17:49.550 --> 17:54.630
Surely this isn't theory. I just have to think of it as fact.

18:02.160 --> 18:03.450
What's wrong?

18:03.450 --> 18:04.890
I can't light the fire again.

18:05.340 --> 18:07.180
I wonder if the matches are damp.

18:07.870 --> 18:10.400
Fel, can you light it up with your magic?

18:10.550 --> 18:11.840
Leave it to me.

18:15.930 --> 18:17.160
I'm so sorry.

18:17.160 --> 18:21.040
I see, it's because I've been using ice magic too much lately.

18:21.040 --> 18:22.200
Hey!

18:22.460 --> 18:23.730
Onii-chan.

18:23.730 --> 18:24.350
Hyaweh.

18:26.150 --> 18:28.100
Onii-chan, is it all right?

18:28.100 --> 18:28.750
Leave it to me.

18:29.540 --> 18:32.310
Obey my words and gather in my hand.

18:32.310 --> 18:35.990
The great power of desire,
the flame of the sleeping salamander.

18:37.840 --> 18:39.070
Amazing!

18:39.070 --> 18:40.590
You did it, you did it!

18:40.590 --> 18:42.050
That's pretty good.

18:42.050 --> 18:43.560
It's all thanks to you.

18:43.560 --> 18:44.540
Me?

18:44.880 --> 18:49.520
Yeah. I can somewhat control magic now.

18:50.010 --> 18:54.240
Thanks to your advice, I remembered the promise I made to Filia.

18:54.240 --> 18:55.910
Ah, that promise.

18:56.500 --> 18:58.030
What promise?

18:58.360 --> 19:02.660
A promise to definitely protect Filia.

19:05.310 --> 19:06.970
That's pretty cool.

19:17.230 --> 19:21.090
Beside a waterfall and a cute nesagi, the sun rises up.

19:25.830 --> 19:27.420
Have you figured out how to do it?

19:28.670 --> 19:30.650
Whether I figured it out or not, get your sword.

19:42.540 --> 19:43.660
Come at me.

19:56.610 --> 19:59.450
Your movements have changed. That was a good move.

20:08.880 --> 20:09.680
Splendid.

20:09.950 --> 20:13.370
It's still far from what the instructor did.

20:13.370 --> 20:15.980
I only have two strikes in one attack.

20:16.960 --> 20:19.040
But your hesitation has disappeared.

20:19.040 --> 20:22.150
That thrust just now has evolved from Glow Lash.

20:22.150 --> 20:27.270
Soon, when it has three strikes,
having that phantom like swordplay...

20:27.730 --> 20:29.750
Then, you can call it "Mirage Lash".

20:29.990 --> 20:32.120
Mirage Lash?

20:33.300 --> 20:34.650
Well then, ladies and gentlemen!

20:34.650 --> 20:36.930
It's the time for the Pri-test!

20:36.930 --> 20:40.590
Do your best to shine up those Prisms of yours.

20:42.750 --> 20:44.720
Well then, let's begin the test!

20:44.820 --> 20:47.820
Shine! The Prism of heart!

20:51.000 --> 20:53.270
My... I feel so satisfied.

20:53.750 --> 20:57.350
Everyone was indeed able to skillfully use their Prisms.

20:57.350 --> 20:59.030
What do you two think?

20:59.310 --> 21:02.770
It's the first time in history that so many passed the exam on the first try.

21:02.770 --> 21:08.000
This is because of the motivation of Priecia, and because the morale of the school is rising too.

21:08.660 --> 21:10.490
It's all thanks to Instructor Karin.

21:10.990 --> 21:16.790
Even though Priecia didn't know what to do at first, it seems like she has finally discarded her hesitation.

21:16.790 --> 21:19.550
We can look forward to her performance in an actual battle.

21:19.670 --> 21:22.260
Yes, that's good, that's good.

21:22.260 --> 21:26.800
With this, I feel like we can allow them to participate in official missions now.

21:26.920 --> 21:31.240
Hmm? Can we just ignore the results
of our students' hard work?

21:31.240 --> 21:33.480
No, we can't! Full stop.

21:33.510 --> 21:36.520
Everyone passed the Pri-test!

21:35.980 --> 21:41.820
P
a
s
s
e
d

21:36.520 --> 21:38.420
Yes, please wait a moment.

21:38.420 --> 21:40.850
There are three students who failed the test.

21:40.850 --> 21:41.700
There are?!

21:42.260 --> 21:44.990
Was it us?

21:56.000 --> 22:02.230
When the star has fallen and the day becomes night,

22:02.610 --> 22:09.050
will the noise that I heard until yesterday disappear, too?

22:09.050 --> 22:15.840
In this brief moment of gentle wind, the sunlight shining through the trees

22:15.840 --> 22:22.530
gives me warmth in this dull scenery,

22:22.770 --> 22:29.620
so that I will still go on and reach that feeling!

22:30.120 --> 22:37.620
Even if I'm crying, even if I'm painfully wandering.

22:37.620 --> 22:43.550
I believe in your only radiance over there.

22:43.550 --> 22:50.820
Like the mists that shrouded the raining Earth,

22:51.130 --> 22:57.600
if all the meeting can be repeated on this planet,

22:57.850 --> 23:05.050
within this strange power, it will change into a miracle.

23:14.950 --> 23:17.870
Next Episode

23:16.130 --> 23:17.030
I see...

23:17.030 --> 23:21.830
Even though the test has just ended,
they are going to have fun now?

23:21.830 --> 23:23.650
Geez, listen up!

23:23.650 --> 23:26.280
As a student, you need to study properly.

23:26.280 --> 23:29.840
In short, activities other than studying are strictly forbidden.

23:30.240 --> 23:32.690
Next, the Knights' Holiday.

23:32.690 --> 23:35.770
Shine! The Pri... of heart... Eh? It's over already?!

23:34.600 --> 23:38.940
The Knights' Holiday

23:35.770 --> 23:39.180
Wait! Don't end it! I still have things to say! Hey!
